  "notes": "A legal and administrative term that learners in Japan will encounter when buying property, starting a business, or dealing with official documents. The {法務局|ほうむきょく} (Legal Affairs Bureau) handles registration in Japan.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {不動産|ふどうさん}{登記|とうき} — real estate registration\n- {商業|しょうぎょう}{登記|とうき} — commercial registration\n- {登記|とうき}{簿|ぼ} — register, registry book\n- {登記|とうき}{所|しょ} — registry office\n- {所有権|しょゆうけん}{移転|いてん}{登記|とうき} — ownership transfer registration\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {登録|とうろく} — registration (more general; used for memberships, accounts, etc.)\n- {届出|とどけで} — notification, filing (e.g., marriage registration at city hall)",
